# NODE DETAILS DOCUMENTATION

---

# 1️⃣ Form Trigger Node

## Node Name

`On form submission`

## Purpose

Captures customer support requests through an n8n form interface.

## Input Fields

- Name
- Email
- Message

## Workflow Role

Acts as the entry point of the automation workflow.

---

# 2️⃣ Intent + Sentiment AI Agent

## Node Name

`Gemini AI Intent and sentiment Agent`

## Purpose

Analyzes customer messages and detects:

- customer intent
- customer sentiment

## Possible Intent Outputs

- Payment Issue
- Technical Support
- Account Recovery
- Sales Inquiry
- General Query

## Possible Sentiment Outputs

- Angry
- Neutral
- Happy

## Workflow Role

Performs intelligent customer issue analysis.

---

# 3️⃣ Edit Fields Node

## Node Name

`Edit Fields`

## Purpose

Extracts Intent and Sentiment into separate text fields.

## Extracted Fields

- Intent
- Sentiment

## Workflow Role

Converts AI output into structured workflow data.

---

# 4️⃣ Priority AI Agent

## Node Name

`Gemini AI Priority Agent`

## Purpose

Determines support ticket priority using:

- Intent
- Sentiment

## Possible Outputs

- High
- Medium
- Normal

## Workflow Role

Performs intelligent ticket escalation analysis.

---

# 5️⃣ Response AI Agent

## Node Name

`Gemini AI Response Agent`

## Purpose

Generates automated professional customer support replies.

## Workflow Role

Automates customer communication.

---

# 6️⃣ IF Condition Node

## Node Name

`If`

## Purpose

Checks whether the generated priority is High.

## TRUE Branch

Urgent support handling.

## FALSE Branch

Normal support handling.

## Workflow Role

Performs intelligent workflow routing.

